    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/874ab6a9966d0fb0b42c00d7d63483e6.poster.avif?t=1754506588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/874ab6a9966d0fb0b42c00d7d63483e6.webm?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/874ab6a9966d0fb0b42c00d7d63483e6.mp4?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Two magical girls discover a latent power within you... and now they want to steal magic energy from you to use for their own selfish purposes.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/3973e26268836129c8f0aefd0d701787.webp?t=1754506588\" /></div><br>The pure-hearted heroine will destroy evil... when it's convenient for her. She puts on a show for fans and supporters, but secretly cares only about her growing popularity, and is willing to commit all kinds of vile crimes to remain famous.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/7b061ab8bc445e06f68c64633d71cf7c.poster.avif?t=1754506588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/7b061ab8bc445e06f68c64633d71cf7c.webm?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/7b061ab8bc445e06f68c64633d71cf7c.mp4?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/c73b91100135aaf5ef0ef4700d006b5a.webp?t=1754506588\" /></div><br>This wicked and selfish villainess doesn't care about her reputation so long as she gets her way! Kidnapping, grand theft, and even murder?! She'll do it all to further her selfish goals!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/b60cc222d1e730c1e7674eef9c23fcea.poster.avif?t=1754506588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/b60cc222d1e730c1e7674eef9c23fcea.webm?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/b60cc222d1e730c1e7674eef9c23fcea.mp4?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>These two girls fight over your &quot;love&quot;, draining your latent magic out of you with their tempting bodies, all with the aim of turning you into their toy, and a dehumanized tool to fight each other for dominance and rule the city as the victor...<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/7d9bf7225c9197aa161d2be108401876.poster.avif?t=1754506588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/7d9bf7225c9197aa161d2be108401876.webm?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/7d9bf7225c9197aa161d2be108401876.mp4?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/fd1f5c521c483cd4d8951c6d0cc4b1b1.poster.avif?t=1754506588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/fd1f5c521c483cd4d8951c6d0cc4b1b1.webm?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/fd1f5c521c483cd4d8951c6d0cc4b1b1.mp4?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>But as they torment you, a seed of burning hatred grows inside you. The greedy pair of magical girls will be the target of your revenge vengeance, and they will be punished for their evil deeds!<br><br>The magic inside you will help enact sweet, sexy justice! Those who mistreated you will fall from grace, be forced to obey your every whim, and gradually lose the will to resist.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/fbebeeccd2de9557f7a8756df8701ecf.poster.avif?t=1754506588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/fbebeeccd2de9557f7a8756df8701ecf.webm?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/fbebeeccd2de9557f7a8756df8701ecf.mp4?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/b2aa66d68e123e499c4fac0fc273ae1f.poster.avif?t=1754506588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/b2aa66d68e123e499c4fac0fc273ae1f.webm?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126240/extras/b2aa66d68e123e499c4fac0fc273ae1f.mp4?t=1754506588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>This is a tale of abuse, betrayal, and retribution. A chronicle of loveless sex in a struggle for power and control. A story about mating with magical girls.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A lengthy visual novel experience, featuring 30+ animated CGs!<br></li><li>Engage with the story to make an impact! Make choices, fight in turn-based combat, and present evidence to win arguments! Find your way to all the endings!<br></li><li>Treat your ears to full English voice acting, and an original soundtrack!</li></ul>",
